{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "konnectnex-hrms-mobile-collection",
		"name": "Konnect Nex — HRMS Mobile API",
		"description": "Postman collection for the Konnect Nex HRMS Mobile application.\n\nAll endpoints are extracted from the Laravel implementation (`routes/api*.php`).\n\n# Quick start\n\n1. Import this collection into Postman.\n2. Set collection variables:\n   - `base_url` — e.g. `http://localhost/nova-crm/public` or `https://your-nova-crm.host`\n   - `api_token` — Sanctum personal access token (Settings → API Tokens in web UI; requires `api.tokens`)\n   - `organization_id` — tenant ID from Organization Settings → Billing/Profile\n   - `user_id` — authenticated user ID (for task filters)\n   - `employee_id` — linked employee ID (optional)\n   - `task_id` / `project_id` — for task/project detail calls\n3. Run **Setup → Health Check (Attendance Dashboard)** to verify auth.\n\n# Authentication\n\nKonnect Nex has **no mobile login API**. Create a Sanctum PAT in the web UI and paste it into `api_token`.\n\n```\nAuthorization: Bearer {{api_token}}\nAccept: application/json\nX-Organization-Id: {{organization_id}}\n```\n\n# Permissions (typical employee)\n\n| Feature | Permission |\n| --- | --- |\n| Attendance | `ess.access` |\n| Dashboard | `dashboard.view` |\n| Leave balance widget | `leave.view` |\n| Manager team summary | `manager.dashboard` |\n| Lookups | `hrms.view` |\n| Tasks/Projects | `api.access` + `tasks.view` |\n\n# API coverage\n\n| Available | Not yet implemented |\n| --- | --- |\n| Attendance dashboard, check-in/out | Leave apply/history |\n| Dashboard widgets | ESS profile |\n| Lookups (employees, depts, etc.) | Documents, payroll |\n| RBAC authorization | Notification inbox |\n| Tasks & projects (optional) | Push device registration |\n\nSee `docs/mobile/README.md` for full documentation.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
		"version": "1.1.0"
	},
	"auth": {
		"type": "bearer",
		"bearer": [
			{
				"key": "token",
				"value": "{{api_token}}",
				"type": "string"
			}
		]
	},
	"event": [
		{
			"listen": "prerequest",
			"script": {
				"type": "text/javascript",
				"exec": [
					"const orgId = pm.collectionVariables.get('organization_id');",
					"if (orgId && pm.request.auth?.type !== 'noauth') {",
					"    pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-Organization-Id', value: String(orgId) });",
					"}",
					"pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'Accept', value: 'application/json' });"
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"listen": "test",
			"script": {
				"type": "text/javascript",
				"exec": [
					"if (pm.response.code === 401) {",
					"    console.warn('401 Unauthenticated — check api_token');",
					"}",
					"if (pm.response.code === 403) {",
					"    console.warn('403 Forbidden — check permission or module license');",
					"}"
				]
			}
		}
	],
	"variable": [
		{ "key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost/nova-crm/public" },
		{ "key": "api_token", "value": "" },
		{ "key": "organization_id", "value": "1" },
		{ "key": "user_id", "value": "1" },
		{ "key": "employee_id", "value": "1" },
		{ "key": "task_id", "value": "1" },
		{ "key": "project_id", "value": "1" },
		{ "key": "invitation_token", "value": "" },
		{ "key": "lookup_query", "value": "" }
	],
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "0. Setup & Auth",
			"description": "Token setup and connectivity checks.",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "How to get API token (Web UI)",
					"request": {
						"auth": { "type": "noauth" },
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api-tokens",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api-tokens"]
						},
						"description": "Browser-only page. Log in, open **Settings → API Tokens**, create a token, copy plaintext value into collection variable `api_token`.\n\nRequires permissions: `api.tokens`"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Health Check — Attendance Dashboard",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"type": "text/javascript",
								"exec": [
									"pm.test('Status is 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
									"const json = pm.response.json();",
									"if (json.empty_state) {",
									"    pm.test('Empty state — no employee linked', () => pm.expect(json.empty_state).to.be.true);",
									"} else if (json.data) {",
									"    pm.test('Has attendance state', () => pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property('state'));",
									"}"
								]
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/attendance/dashboard",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "attendance", "dashboard"]
						},
						"description": "Verifies Bearer token, organization context, and `ess.access` permission.\n\nPermission: `ess.access`\nModule: `hrms`"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Activate Invitation (Public)",
					"request": {
						"auth": { "type": "noauth" },
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"{{invitation_token}}\",\n  \"password\": \"SecurePass123!\",\n  \"password_confirmation\": \"SecurePass123!\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/invitations/activate",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "invitations", "activate"]
						},
						"description": "Public endpoint. No auth required. Throttle: 10/min.\n\nUsed when employee accepts email invitation."
					},
					"response": []
				}
			]
		},
